5: Finally, you'll need to reload your BBSMENU/BBSTEXT files by either doing
   a reboot (CNet 2.63), or pressing RAMIGA-T (CNet 3.0P). Provided you have
   your HELP LEVEL set low enough, you'll be presented with a QUIP. You can
   EDIT a quip, regardless of your HELP LEVEL by typing "EQ" from anywhere!

That's It Folks!
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    And that's all there is to setting up Quips! You'll notice the command
files are quite small, so as to execute as fast as possible. The Quips,
themselves, are stored in their own individual files for speed also. I tried
using a relative file to store them all, but found it was actually a bit
faster if it didn't have to seek out the location all the time.

